  "details": "Add ID age verification to get a special tag or something that all could see. Almost like what Tinder does with their blue check mark to confirm the account has sent in an ID with a picture to verify that the user is actually who they say they are.\nThis would be totally voluntary but I imagine most everyone who is +18 would be happy to have this feature. \nCost:\nGiven how small the playerbase is, you wouldn't need to purchase any expensive software to manage the process. Realistically you could hire 4-5 interns at $20/hr and have them on an SLA to respond to any tickets sent in for verification within ~ 1-2 weeks. This isn't a difficult work effort on their part. They would just look at the ticket, match the face and ID and then approve/decline the ticket. They should be able to go through 200-300 tickets per day on the low end.",
